.SH NAME
phenotype_result \- 把预测结果合并上模型的元数据，生成最终的表型预测报告
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIphenotype_result(\fBpredicts\fR as any, 
\fBmodels\fR as <generic> ModelLoader, 
\fBdataset\fR as any = \fB<NULL>\fR, 
